WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
From a low lunge, front foot between the hands.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Plant the opposite hand and twist open toward the front leg.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Reach the top arm up or behind you.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Keep the front knee tracking.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Hold, then switch sides.
